sound, technically straightforward to implement incrementally, and directly reduces a recurring bottleneck that slows prototyping cycles when compliance artifacts are needed. I'll approve with a moderate-to-good promise score. Maybe 62-68 range. It's clearly viable and useful but not a breakthrough or critical-path item.\n\nLet me settle on 64.\n",
