t somewhat high-level and has implementation risks (ML-based detection of ML anomalies is circular in some ways). Not a 100 because it's not directly implementing Art 12(1) itself, and the ML-based anomaly detection approach needs careful validation to ensure regulatory reliability. But it clearly supports compliance operations.\n\nI'll go with approve at 74.\n",
