ntly. The resource commitment is proportionate to the compliance benefit.\n\nPromise score: I'd say around 82. It's clearly valuable for compliance, but it's incomplete as a full Article 12 solution and has some gaps (immutability, retention, access control, doesn't fully address event logging). Still, from my vantage point, it meaningfully reduces compliance risk at reasonable cost.\n",
